(text "U18 ON and SPNDPWR are controlled by U21 on USB_GND.\nR112 defaults acquisition OFF; R113 defaults suspend shutdown ON.\nVLO supplies only primary control logic. Do not bridge USB_GND to isolated GND." (at 25 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2bb45464-10ab-491a-a158-cfcd0bf1dabf))
(text "U18 ON and SPNDPWR are controlled by U21 on USB_GND.\nR112 defaults acquisition OFF; R113 defaults suspend shutdown ON.\nVLO supplies only primary control logic. Do not bridge USB_GND to isolated GND." (at 25 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 95f12f95-0546-4649-a229-8ec58d397a50))
(text "VCC2 feeds D1 on the power sheet. Never connect 20V PD to this module. Keep all copper out of the isolation barrier." (at 25 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 40620bf8-1ba6-4ea8-a950-e75f5776d3a7))
(text "FIRMWARE REQUIRED: boot <=16MHz, excitation/comparators off. Sound and Favero stay off throughout laptop-only mode." (at 25 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 81177293-92d0-4d8e-a07d-1014c6a8addf))
(text "Targets: <=20mA isolated before configuration, <=75mA acquisition (<=48MHz, one high source). See usb-acquisition-power.md." (at 25 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid ce0c973a-5e36-417d-a8e5-495ee57fa1ac))
(text "Measure host <=100mA before / <=500mA after configuration; output budget is NOT input proof. Reset returns to low power." (at 25 210 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid c18993eb-d4bc-4872-a08e-45a4bd2e478d))
(text "Laptop product: no HUB75 panel connected; ESP32/Ethernet/IR supply stays off. U18 200mA rating is not an operating target." (at 25 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a88a3aa6-17a4-4584-85a1-b020a1608dde))
(text "U18 ON and SPNDPWR are controlled by U21 on USB_GND.\nR112 defaults acquisition OFF; R113 defaults suspend shutdown ON.\nVLO supplies only primary control logic. Do not bridge USB_GND to isolated GND." (at 25 230 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4087efd5-db67-403d-ab29-bb9acb388aec))
(text "PB5 USB_PRESENT senses isolated 5V on the power sheet. Disable STM32 D+ pull-up while absent, including when PD stays on." (at 25 240 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 187b680d-d2af-4421-af48-486786e02972))
(text "Desktop preserves bout state but discards old capture sessions after reconnect. Timing/suspend/inrush and USB compliance need bench tests." (at 25 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9b2c0150-7a34-4c2c-a6a1-b392d62ca95e))
(text "Source: LTM2884 Rev D pp. 8, 15-17; land pattern 05-08-1881 Rev B. Isolation part rating is not FIE or system safety approval." (at 25 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid d8cf774b-4556-47b8-a0e0-6f8b9d9fe0b4))
(text "Isolated USB data and acquisition power" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 046d8a25-e4b8-4f00-ace0-5a9a39a35deb))
(text "LTM2884IY#PBF: 12Mbit/s data + isolated 5V/200mA. USB idle/sleep removes isolated power; desktop reconnect after wake is the accepted design tradeoff." (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid a94cb4fd-bc92-49bf-aa83-6c67d5a778ed))
